            <div xml:id="m-c54dbd31-9925-4959-bd9c-4aa704352610">
              <lg xml:id="m-80cd1877-3ec5-478a-b14c-19d4ae1c68f0">
                <l xml:id="m-c9906f29-2e2d-4894-8b49-21476cea39fb" facs="#m-42fe445b-7c36-45bd-adee-02d4cf915397" label="text-like">Feast of the Sacred Heart of lesus.</l><l xml:id="m-9e93f0d1-48af-498c-ad58-92baef8b7974" facs="#m-a1f5f949-2ce4-4446-b8ae-d247a36eb901" label="ambiguous">907</l><l xml:id="m-7748f666-5e3e-402a-9656-8938bd51482b" facs="#m-51059026-8e54-4231-a1bc-7f9f722b5023" label="lyrics-like">Ut pro tú-a cleménti- a, Sis praésul et custó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c89b4142-6d47-43f8-b526-97e32c201206" facs="#m-1166e12e-4b8e-4e9a-9562-386affbb765c" label="ambiguous">scimus,</l><l xml:id="m-fc3661ba-9bab-42a0-abd0-9e233bb33837" facs="#m-5e4af19a-7707-422e-ab4d-072c29f88be0" label="lyrics-like">di- a. 2. Procul recé- dant sómni-a Et nócti-um phantás¬</l><l xml:id="m-963f68cb-5dd4-4877-9b7e-16c77f9234d9" facs="#m-c9815755-51b7-4e68-9781-a54268993fd1" label="lyrics-like">ma-ta: Hostémque nó-strum cómprime, Ne pollu-ántur cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab8cea37-fdc3-41d8-8f53-d5aeea190a5c" facs="#m-c9388458-2ff5-416d-9165-b92e5721d819" label="lyrics-like">po-ra. 3. Jé-su, ti-bi sit gló-ri- a, Qui Córde fúndis grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ad34366-7099-4e73-b43d-f60f8ac5d237" facs="#m-df5e3375-5d8d-4190-9e4d-48d0198b8b6c" label="lyrics-like">ti- am, Cum Pâtre et ál-mo Spí-ri-tu,</l><l xml:id="m-83029e33-20cb-48f4-ae67-9e96cbd488b5" facs="#m-11fead84-6b56-4d91-a966-c403dccacdc3" label="lyrics-like">In sempi-térna</l><l xml:id="m-71c17a20-3bc2-4d93-9f0f-1cd0eb7c279c" facs="#m-18f19b71-60fe-4c10-bcb9-453822c4ca82" label="lyrics-like">saécu-la. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b8b767af-3b05-4700-b5b5-17dc017130e1" facs="#m-2151e9ad-a331-491a-bc22-2f21bf5d84a7" label="text-like">The tone and doxology of the Hymn at Compline and at the Little Hours</l><l xml:id="m-c14da125-2bad-4bbc-ad67-339660953f1d" facs="#m-0a5e3122-a002-4cf2-89b7-0cd154ceaea4" label="text-like">are as above throughout the Octave.</l><l xml:id="m-4f2642f4-c987-4465-af2d-83e60cf06b6d" facs="#m-3cfc21c8-dbac-452a-b772-b42b87228560" label="text-like">AT LAUDS.</l><l xml:id="m-bcc6874f-48c6-4f79-98db-4d1c4af147b0" facs="#m-1d8f7e29-a09e-4f9c-b5fb-42cb92afe342" label="text-like">Antiphons of second Vespers, p. 977. Psalms of Feasts, p. 221.</l><l xml:id="m-a83f2e0b-2579-4ee6-a9fe-82f3a0fba1a7" facs="#m-3b089486-00e6-42ea-be7b-41a77d76f33f" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Fratres: Mihi ómnium. of second Vespers, p. 978.</l><l xml:id="m-9b80a2ff-4520-4a69-97cd-ea0422c6d1aa" facs="#m-8d327d9e-bcb2-4f31-be76-60492adcabc9" label="ambiguous">Hymn.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-a7ea7549-33af-43e1-937c-f7eabe709338" facs="#m-d361fca0-e3cb-42b1-91a9-6c7ed4ee7b2c" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-290fcdd2-c496-4057-9b8c-9f9cb2440dfd" facs="#m-9797245c-fcb4-4071-b02a-20c20a8ed7ae" label="lyrics-like">UOR, árca lé- gem cónti-nens Non servi-tú-tis vé-te¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b716a99-40a8-40ae-afa5-09d0e84ea2b8" facs="#m-067eb191-1b0f-4611-9175-879ed9c16f04" label="lyrics-like">ris, Sed grá-ti-ae, sed véni-ae, Sed et mi-se-ricór¬</l><l xml:id="m-f86cede7-6ddb-4ab4-bbb1-8ba2f50907d2" facs="#m-c59f49f8-650e-4e7f-afc6-dc0a9eb25361" label="lyrics-like">Inteme-rá-tum</l><l xml:id="m-6433e073-b2c7-4a56-a041-a311f0284f63" facs="#m-0a137748-23fe-483b-ad3e-5dd2331bf8e4" label="lyrics-like">di-ae. 2. Cor, sanctu-á- ri-um nó-vi</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>